        /// <description>
        /// <para>Queries the processing progress, such as image checking, copying, and starting, by preparation task ID to track the result of the current custom image submission.</para>
        /// <h3>Obtain the task identifier</h3>
        /// <para>Pass the value of <c>imagePreparation.preparationId</c> from the response of creating or updating a custom code or image agent as the <c>preparationId</c> parameter without modification. It identifies the task for the current submission, not the running instance ID.</para>
