        /// </summary>
        /// 
        /// <term><b>Description:</b></term>
        /// <description>
        /// <para>Queries the access configuration and processing progress of SCIM user synchronization to determine whether the receiving end is ready, whether AgentCore user synchronization is enabled, and whether the most recent synchronization operation is completed.
        /// SCIM is a user provisioning protocol. The enterprise identity system sends user information to the user pool through the receiving URL and access token. After AgentCore user synchronization is enabled, users in the user pool are imported into the workspace.</para>
